<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
    <title>Результаты поиска</title>
    {% include 'blocks/head.njk' %}
</head>

<body class="preload mp">
    <div class="main-wrapper-outer">
        {% include 'blocks/header.njk' %}
        <main class="main">

            <div class="block-main">
                <img src="img/list1.webp" alt="" class="block-main__pic1">
                <img src="img/list2.webp" alt="" class="block-main__pic2">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-main__contents">
                        <div class="breadcrumbs">
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="#" class="home">
                                        <img src="img/icons/home.svg" alt="">
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li><span>Результаты поиска</span></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="block-main__content">
                            <div class="block-main__top">
                                <h1 class="title1">
                                    <strong>Результаты поиска</strong>
                                </h1>
                            </div>
                            <div class="block-search">
                                <div class="block-search__input">
                                    <div class="block-search__icon">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#search"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <input autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                        placeholder="Введите название товара или артикул (SKU) ..."
                                        value="Энергетический напиток">
                                    <button type="button" class="block-search__delete">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="10" height="10">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#close"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-blue">
                                    <span>Найти</span>
                                    <div class="btn__arrow">
                                        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                            <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="block-forms block-forms3">
                <img src="img/image8.webp" alt="" class="block-forms__pic1">
                <img src="img/image9.webp" alt="" class="block-forms__pic2">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="block-forms__content">
                        <div class="block-forms__left">
                            <div class="heading-complex">
                                <h2 class="title2">
                                    <span>Запросить ассортимент и условия поставки на категорию «Напитки»</span>
                                </h2>
                                <p>
                                    <strong>Оставьте заявку, и наш менеджер вышлет актуальный каталог с оптовыми
                                        ценами,</strong>
                                    штрих-кодами и логистическими параметрами
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <form action="#" class="form">
                            <div class="form__inputs">
                                <div class="form__input">
                                    <input data-required autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                        placeholder="ИНН компании *" class="input">
                                    <div class="form__placeholder">
                                        ИНН компании <span>*</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form__input">
                                    <input data-required autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                        placeholder="+7 (___) ___-__-__  *" class="input telephone">
                                    <div class="form__placeholder">
                                        <strong>+7</strong> (___) ___-__-__ <span>*</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form__input">
                                    <input data-required autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                        placeholder="Название компании *" class="input">
                                    <div class="form__placeholder">
                                        Название компании <span>*</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form__input">
                                    <input data-required autocomplete="off" type="text" name="form[]"
                                        placeholder="E-mail *" class="input">
                                    <div class="form__placeholder">
                                        E-mail <span>*</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-blue btn-big">
                                <span>Запросить ассортимент и условия поставки</span>
                                <div class="btn__arrow">
                                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="9">
                                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#arrow1"></use>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="block-forms__svg">
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" width="1810" height="461">
                        <use xlink:href="img/sprite.svg#logo2"></use>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>
        {% include 'blocks/footer.njk' %}
    </div>
    {% include 'blocks/scripts.njk' %}
</body>

</html>